  "The connection to the torrent engine dropped mid-stream.": "Veza s torrent motorom prekinula se usred streama.",
  "The device this was cast from answered HTTP {status}. It may have stopped serving the film.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The device this was cast from answered HTTP {status}. It may have stopped serving the film.",
  "The device this was cast from couldn't be reached. Check it is still on and on this network.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: The device this was cast from couldn't be reached. Check it is still on and on this network.",
  "The download couldn't be started.": "Preuzimanje se nije moglo pokrenuti.",
  "The download didn't finish.": "Preuzimanje nije dovršeno.",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "Iznimka je Dolby ili DTS proslijeđen ravno prijemniku preko HDMI-ja, što Android radi gdje može — ništa u aplikaciji ne dira taj zvuk, pa na njega ne utječe nijedna postavka. Pojačalo koje to radi ima vlastiti noćni način rada.",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "Film se reproducira onako kako je miksan.",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "Poveznica koju je dao ovaj izvor vratila je HTTP {status}. Možda je istekla — ponovno pretraži izvore za novu.",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "Do poveznice koju je dao ovaj izvor nije bilo moguće doprijeti.",
  "The other device refused the film.": "Drugi uređaj odbio je film.",
  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "Drugi uređaj prenosi ovaj film odavde, pa se ništa ne preuzima dvaput. Oba moraju biti na istoj mreži, a na njemu emitiranje mora biti uključeno pod Postavke → Mreža.",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "Slika koja je trenutačno iza aplikacije",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "Područje reproduktora nikad nije dobilo veličinu, pa reprodukcija nije pokrenuta.",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "Sam reproduktor — dekodiranje, titlovi i zvuk. GPLv2 ili noviji.",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Projekt ne hostira, ne vodi, ne podržava i ne preporučuje nijedan izvor te ne dijeli njihov popis.",
  "The project on GitHub": "Projekt na GitHubu",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "Izdanje ne sadrži ažuriranje za ovu platformu.",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "Izvor je to već dohvatio — reproducira se odmah i ne ostavlja ništa na ovom uređaju",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "Popis podupiratelja nije se mogao učitati — aktualni je na Ko-fi stranici iznad.",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "Torrent motor prihvatio je magnet, ali mu nije dodijelio ID.",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "Torrent motor, ugrađen u aplikaciju. Pod MIT licencom.",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Torrent stream još nije spreman (motor je vratio HTTP {status}). Možda još dohvaća metapodatke od parnjaka.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Ažuriranje nije bilo moguće instalirati: {error}",
  "Theme": "Tema",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Ovdje jedva ima mjesta za jedan film. Priključi USB disk u uređaj — formatiran kao FAT32, što prihvaća svaki Android uređaj — i pojavit će se iznad da na njega preuzimaš.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Nema računa za prijavu i ništa se ne sinkronizira na poslužitelj. Što gledaš, dokle si stigao, tvoji favoriti i tvoj popis za gledanje sve se sprema na ovaj uređaj i nikad ga ne napušta. Sinkronizacija među zaslonima je u planu; do tada je sigurnosna kopija ispod način da knjižnica prijeđe.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "U tvojoj mapi dokumenata nema {file}. Kopiraj jedan onamo i pokušaj ponovno.",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "Ova veza trenutačno naplaćuje promet.",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "Ova veza trenutačno ne naplaćuje promet.",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "Ovu kopiju nije instalirao Venticov vlastiti instalater — nego upravitelj paketa ili je izgrađena iz izvornog koda — pa je ažurira ono što ju je ondje postavilo. Zamjena datoteka odavde samo bi ga zbunila.",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "Ovaj uređaj nije mogao početi posluživati film mreži.",
  "This device is called": "Ovaj uređaj se zove",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "Ovaj uređaj upravo sada prenosi film na drugi.",
  "This device is streaming a film to {device} right now.": "Ovaj uređaj upravo sada prenosi film na {device}.",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "Ovaj uređaj mu prenosi film. Ostavi Ventic otvoren dok ne završiš — zatvaranje prekida prijenos.",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "Ovaj uređaj nije na mreži koju Ventic vidi. Umjesto toga upiši adresu drugog uređaja.",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "Dekoder ovog uređaja odustao je od datoteke. Obično je krivac zvuk: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) i DTS nisu licencirani u sistemskom webprikazu, pa se izdanje s takvim zvukom reproducira kao slika bez zvuka, ili nikako. Izdanje x264 s AAC zvukom će se reproducirati.",
  "This file has one audio track.": "Ova datoteka ima jedan zvučni zapis.",
